{"id":"cogido","lemma":"cogido","pos":"adj","rank":2006,"glosses":["taken (by the hand, etc.)"],"ipa":"/koˈxido/","forms":{"feminine":"cogida","masculinePlural":"cogidos","femininePlural":"cogidas"},"examples":[{"text":"¿De dónde has cogido el dinero?","en":"Where did you get the money from?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630348","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"La policía le ha cogido.","en":"The police have caught him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639552","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"Has cogido peso, ¿verdad?","en":"You've put on weight, haven't you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352934","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"weight"},{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"No he cogido tanto peso.","en":"I haven't put on that much weight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518686","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"copy"},{"g":"weight"}]},{"text":"Si hubiera cogido ese avión, ahora estaría muerto.","en":"If I had taken that plane, I would be dead now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691973","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"aeroplane"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"dead"}]}]}